  "implemented": [
    "VoiceModelInventoryOwner borrows actual AuthenticatedSecretStorage and trusted profile/model/inventory roots. Domain-separated AES-GCM receipts bind the exact catalogue archive, root identities and complete bounded no-follow tree/hash inventory. No new key, crypto algorithm or plaintext receipt storage is introduced.",
    "Prepared receipt is authenticated and directory-synced before publication; committed receipt follows exact published-tree verification. Only unambiguous committed receipts authorize restart removal. Prepared, retiring, dual, changed, historic, wrong-key/profile and tampered state refuses deletion, preserving exact files and quarantine for explicit recovery.",
    "Actual synthesis manager requires the durable owner in production; controlled memory-only fixtures opt in explicitly. Downloads, receipt reads/writes, raw descriptor close, publication and exact retirement remain owned through grant loss/shutdown. Cleanup removes only captured files and empty directories, preserving additional private-stage and model bytes.",
    "Production voice identity checks capture actual protected storage and roots. Raw inventory drain is part of the actual voice/model shutdown before database/profile lock/key release. Actual singleton same-key restart exercises authenticated retained receipts, added-user-file preservation and later unchanged-tree removal.",
    "Recognition policy starts only from frozen pinned Hugging Face catalogue resources. Manual bounded redirects keep repository/revision/file and approved finite CDN path/hash/metadata bindings, omit credentials, join each intermediate body cancellation and retain the final response until manager cleanup. Final exact catalogue size/SHA256 remains authoritative; Xet CAS hash is separately bound. Unknown hosts, paths, schemes, ports, metadata, query keys, loops, grant loss and cancellation refuse without broadening scope.",
    "Portable catalogue deadline and per-write current guards bound accepted downloads without releasing ignored raw cancellation. Electron range/resume behavior remains compatible; fixed diagnostics omit signed query material."
  ],
